@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc: Route110_Text_WhichShouldIChoose
Hoenn_Route110_Text_WhichShouldIChoose::
	.string "Which should I choose?\p"
	.string "Make a beeline for MAUVILLE on\n"
	.string "CYCLING ROAD, or take the low road\l"
	.string "and look for POKéMON?$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc: Route110_Text_WalkOnTheLowRoad
Hoenn_Route110_Text_WalkOnTheLowRoad::
	.string "I don't have a BIKE, so I'll take\n"
	.string "a leisurely walk on the low road.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc: Route110_Text_TwoRoads
