	.string "The two roads, one above, one below…\p"
	.string "A road each for people and POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Perhaps that is right and fair.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc: Route110_Text_RideBikeAtFullSpeed
